units si
dimension 3
boundary f f f
atom_style bond
atom_modify map array sort 0 0
newton on off
processors 1 1 1
read_restart /workspace/y_clot/project/verification/lps_native_state_identity_and_fracture_bugfix_v1/20261011T203015Z/original_fracture/tiny.restart
lattice sc 5.0000000000000002e-05
neighbor 5.0000000000000002e-05 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
comm_modify cutoff 0.00045149999999999997
fix props all property/atom d_vfrac d_theta ghost yes
special_bonds lj 0 1 1 coul 1 1 1
timestep 5e-7
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms bonds pe
thermo_modify lost error lost/bond error
run 0
